Error [E0212]: `values` cannot be passed with write access while `window` is still looking into it
  --> inline_module_write_argument_conflicts_with_live_view_once.jet:11:17
    |
 11 |     edit.touch(&values)
    |                 ^^^^^^
 Why: `window` is a live read view into `values[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `window` before changing `values`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
